Ah, well.  If your whole point is avoid a crash, you can always try:

#include <signal.h>
static void myHandler(int i)
{
  signal(i, myHandler);
}

And add this near the start of the main program:

  signal(SIGFPE, myHandler);

But then again, it might be better to actually fix the code...

Cheers,
					Christian





