Hi Erik,

The LX's flash ROM pretty much only has room for one flash image.
Usually it is SRM or AlphaBIOS.  You indicate that you have it loading
MILO automatically.  Is the system booting into AlphaBIOS first and
then loading MILO or is it loading MILO directly?

Alan

