SRM only recognizes your IDE device dqa, Not SCSI devides. Try 
installing and setting up an IDE hard disk for the boot partition and 
let LINUX configure and use the SCSI devices,.
Then linux will work fine with  SCSI
antonio gonzalez
antonio@bierzonet.es


