How does one adjust keyboard autorepeat in XFree86 4.0.1?  Autorepeat in
/etc/X11/XF86Config is 500 5. Setting it to 500 50 does nothing.  (Log
entries in /var/log/XFree86.0.log always says "5".) Adding the AutoRepeat
option to XF86Config-4 keyboard section prevents X from starting. xset r
<delay> <rate> produces a help screen, though xset r off/on work.

I've seen no reports of this so far. The problem must be here.

Thanks.

