Hmmm... I have USB working in my LX for quite sometime now.  I don't
recall the first kernel I used it with.  Most recently 2.4.17 & .18 work
for me.  The .17 kernel was stock and the .18 has been only patched with
the super page patch.  On the hardware side, I have used two different cards.
Originally, a Belkin USB/Firewire combo card and lately a SIIG USB 2.0 card
(no 2.0 devices tho).  Both cards use the usb-ohci driver.  I don't know if
it matters, but the card is in the top 32bit PCI slot.

HTH,
Alan

