you probably don't see anymore for a reason.  Problems with the cable
snapped off a screw in the card's female cable connector.  Adaptec gave
us a 39160 card in exchange for delivering the cable that failed to their
QA/QC group.  That was very nice of them.  Worked fine with a UP2000.
No complaints.

    douglas

