Hey all.

The cooling fan on my 164LX has started making an alarming
amount of noise and I've decided to change it before being
driven deaf.

The manual says that the fan must have a built-in sensor that
will detect the absence of airflow and restart the system.
I suppose I'm not going to be able to use a PC cooling fan, am I?
Does anybody know if this kind of fan can be easily brought?

Emmanuel




