Hello Ted,

I personally do not see a need for 7.3 for Alpha.  If you compare the 
individual packages in RH 7.2 for Alpha and RH 7.[2-3] for Intel, then I 
suspect that you will find that  RH 7.2 for Alpha is much closer to RH 7.3 
for Intel than RH 7.2 for Intel.  If you do the comparison, please do not get 
hung up on version numbers.  You have to look at the code to get a good 
picture of what is happening.  For example, the kernel is labeled 2.4.9-32.5, 
which would lead you to believe that it is just 2.4.9 plus some bug fixes, 
but it has lots of interesting bits that where back-ported from 2.4.12, 
2.4.16, 2.4.18, etc.....

I hope this helps.

Best Regards,


--George


