No, the XL 300 only has AlphaBios as well (same for XL366 and XL433). There were some issues recently getting MILO to boot on the XL not too long back, but I believe Jay's patches fixed them and the latest 2.2 based MILO images work fine now.

The XL233/266 and XL300/366/433 are very different systems despite their names. The former are EV45 based. The latter were EV5 based(XL300) and EV56 based(XL 366/433).

