Jay,

I'm pretty sure the 32MB of memory is not sufficient for the install. 
This is based on experience and earlier recommendations from this list.

Unfortunately, I've been having a difficult time finding memory that 
will work.  I've ordered used memory on-line; first batch didn't work, 
replacement batch with parity didn't work.

In a recent search of the web, I found a web site in Dutch that 
indicated "36 bit ( true parity,ecc ) 60/70 ns fp simms" are needed.

Recently Jeff Donsbach at HP posted to this list recommending "72 Pin 
Fast Page Mode ECC SIMMS w/ Parity. "

Look's like I need to find some ECC memory.

-- Scott

